            "acc_1_title": "What does it help with?",
            "acc_1_body": "Soursop leaf contains powerful acetogenins, prized for their role in advanced cellular defense:\n\n- Supports the body’s defenses against abnormal cells\n- Promotes healthy cellular growth and balance\n- Supports natural killer cell activity\n- Helps protect cells from oxidative damage",
            "acc_2_title": "When will I see results?",
            "acc_2_body": "Many people report stronger energy, improved stamina, and faster recovery within 2–4 weeks. By 60–90 days, the deeper effects become measurable, with increased natural killer-cell activity, improved white blood cell counts, and stronger cellular defenses against abnormal cells.",
            "acc_3_title": "How It Works",
            "acc_3_body": "Soursop leaf contains a powerful combination of natural compounds that target the biological processes cancer cells depend on.\n\nAt the center are acetogenins, compounds that interfere with cellular energy production. Alongside them, natural flavonoids and alkaloids act on oxidative stress and cell-growth pathways.\n\nFour powerful mechanisms work together:\n\n• Disrupts Cancer Cell Energy: Acetogenins interfere with ATP production, the fuel cells need to survive and multiply.\n• Targets Abnormal Cell Growth: Plant compounds act on the signals responsible for uncontrolled cell division.\n• Activates Cellular Self-Destruction: Supports apoptosis, the body’s natural process for eliminating damaged cells.\n• Strengthens Cellular Defense: Flavonoids such as quercetin and rutin help combat oxidative stress and protect cellular integrity.\n\nChemotherapy uses powerful drugs to attack cancer, while soursop leaf contains compounds that work on cellular energy and growth pathways in a different way. That’s why we focused Avonent on the compounds found naturally in soursop leaves instead of adding another complicated blend of herbs and vitamins.",
            "trust_image_alt": ""
          }
        },
